# === Build output ===
**/target/
**/dist/
**/build/

# === Dependencies ===
node_modules/

# === IDE ===
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
*.iml

# === OS ===
.DS_Store

# === Logs ===
*.log

# === Environment / local secrets ===
.env
.env.*
application-local.properties
application-local.yml
application-secrets.properties
application-secrets.yml
*.pem
*.key

# === Leftover scaffolding (outside the real app directory) ===
# Only the stray files directly under foodVilla_frontend/ are ignored here.
# The leading "/" anchors these to the repo root, so the real app's
# foodVilla_frontend/foodvilla_frontend/package.json (and lockfile) are
# NOT matched by these rules and remain tracked/committable.
/foodVilla_frontend/package.json
/foodVilla_frontend/package-lock.json
